WEBVTT

00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:01.730
Every video you make

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:02.845
leaves pieces
behind.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:06.695
In Fablecut,
each one

00:00:06.695 --> 00:00:08.709
becomes an asset:
searchable,

00:00:08.709 --> 00:00:10.745
versioned, and ready
for the next clip.

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:15.862
Nine clips added
eighty-three assets

00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:18.002
to the library,
and two clips needed

00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:18.992
no new code at all.

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:24.425
Make your next video
with code, in

00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:25.225
Fablecut.

